 her heart racing, because Arthur is head over heels for Marie, and her human identity is nearly exposed!\n\nA maid pretending to be a robot x A young heir who hates humans. Get ready for a heartwarming comedy that’ll make you laugh and cry! What began as a lie between master and maid blossoms into a love neither of them saw coming.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Maids","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shoujo","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Assassins","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Marriage","rank":48,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Estranged Family","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Mechanical Marie","english":"Mechanical Marie","native":"機械じかけのマリー","romaji":"Kikaijikake no Marie","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"人形机器人玛丽"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机械女仆·玛丽"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"機械女僕·瑪麗"}]},"trailer":{"id":"X0um7anNddA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X0um7anNddA/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}